      ],
      "text": "Protocol v2 agent definitions include fields v, name, emoji, sys, hello, temp (default 0.7), profile (auto|mobile|balanced|quality|vision), and an optional modelHint that is a preference, not a requirement."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c11a1bc7432ed5d70836261b69b156ed3fafa8a5e29d8fbcf62313553346a244",
