        "slc_239fbbb7f7a3e9612ef47702acc69cab1c0ede8424b24dfa0f5a597cbdbeb218"
      ],
      "text": "The decoder supports fallbacks: '2u.' for uncompressed v2 payloads when deflate-raw is unavailable, and legacy '2.' v2 and plain-base64url v1 links remain readable with v1 upgraded in memory."
    },
